acceptance_criteria: "A rendered cmd recovery command run through a generated npm .cmd shim delivers the original argv byte for byte, or the receipt withholds the executable form for arguments it cannot carry; The rendered-command shell-safety corpus runs through a generated .cmd shim on the Windows native cohort"
